OL,3,A'What you see is what you pay' - why
OL,4,Asome US restaurants are banning tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FKraetzer says it is good to no longer
OL,7,Fbe "reliant on the generosity of
OL,8,Fstrangers to pay the bills".
